cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Open Data Center Atlas, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Open Data Center Atlas: data center builds, with every number sourced"
authors:
  - family-names: Kyars
    given-names: Kian
url: "https://kiankyars.github.io/semiconductor-atlas/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kiankyars/semiconductor-atlas"
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: "2026-10-09"
keywords:
  - data centers
  - AI infrastructure
  - electric power
  - construction
  - open data
abstract: >-
  An open dataset of large data center builds worldwide. Each record links planned and
  operational power, investment, status, organizations and milestones to the public sources
  that reported them, with explicit power basis and scope. Distributed as CSV, JSON, GeoJSON,
  SQLite, Excel and Parquet with a static JSON API.
